  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Thickness&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Reading&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math> Circular Scale Reading <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Here least count is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>002</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>per</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>division</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>From all the four options, the second answer is divisible by this least count. Hence option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;is correct.</p>",
